    "body": "Is that refactor really needed?\r\nI thought we could just modify the initialization scripts. Something around,\r\n\r\n  https://github.com/Dietr1ch/starship/compare/master...Dietr1ch:dumb-term  (github's differ fails to show the code moves :cry:)\r\n\r\ni'm just setting the prompt to `$ ` instead of setting up starship if `TERM=dumb` is detected.\r\nIt won't setup each shell to fully respect the `terminfo` setup, but it'll stop from making things\r\nworse by setting up a nice prompt.",
